{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"All recipients who received organs from the same donor as the liver recipient were evaluated for donor-derived HBV infection using the same criteria.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Behavioral risk factors were identified through next-of kin interviews or review of medical records.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"outcome_types\", \"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}